Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.68,0:00:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: I just want to say, my name is Chang,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: and this is my grandfather, Mr. Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: I didn't get your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: I guess you didn't, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: Another one, honey. Same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: Double?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:00:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: Sure about that, Doc. He would drink the doubles all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: All right. Make it a triple.